        "original_id": "3c174239-603a-5b2d-8c45-6106f42dc642",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: IO Theater, Comedy Central, CBS, Georgia News Network, WZQZ\n- People: Stephen Colbert, Amy Poehler\n- Products: The Colbert Report, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert, Stephen Colbert Presents Stephen Colbert's Alpha Squad 7: A Tek Jansen Adventure\n- Characters: Tek Jansen\n- Topics: notable alumni, television hosting, animated shorts, comic series, news broadcasts\n\nFacts:\n- IO Theater has notable alumni including Amy Poehler and Stephen Colbert.\n- Stephen Colbert hosted the satirical Comedy Central program The Colbert Report from 2005 to 2014.\n- In 2007, Tek Jansen became the protagonist of a five-part comic series.\n- Tek Jansen later appeared in a series of animated shorts titled Stephen Colbert Presents Stephen Colbert's Alpha Squad 7: A Tek Jansen Adventure, with Stephen Colbert voicing Jansen.\n- Stephen Colbert began hosting the CBS talk program The Late Show with Stephen Colbert in September 2015.\n- WZQZ is associated with CBS and the Georgia News Network for news broadcasts and produces its own local news programs.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
